    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Nege\namerica\nINFLIGHT TEAMMATE\nWORK RULES",
      "Virgin America\nINFLIGHT WORK RULES\nOct. 1, 2013\nRev. 5\nTABLE OF CONTENTS\nFOREWORD\nCHAPTER 1-COMPANY AND INFLIGHT SENIORITY SYSTEMS\nA. COMPANY SENIORITY\nB. INFLIGHT SENIORITY\nC. SENIORITY REQUIREMENTS FOR WORKING AS ITL\nD. ADDITIONAL ITL REQUIREMENTS\nE. ITL DOWNGRADE\nSENIORITY PROTECTION IN THE EVENT OF\nFURLOUGH\nG. SENIORITY PROTECTION IN THE EVENT OF MERGER\n1\n5\n5\n5\nCHAPTER 2-RELIABILITY POLICY AND PERFORMANCE\nEXPECTATIONS\nA. RELIABILITY POLICY\nB. POINT SYSTEM\nPOINT ACCRUALS FOR RESERVES\nPOINT ACCRUALS FOR LINEHOLDERS\nCORRECTIVE ACTION\n\"CALLING IN WELL\"\nRECORD IMPROVEMENT\nSTUFF HAPPENS PASS\nC. THE RELIABILITY POLICY AND LEAVES OF ABSENCE\nD. PERFORMANCE EXPECTATIONS\nE. SAFETY/SECURITY\nF. PROGRESSIVE DISCIPLINE, JUST CAUSE AND THE\nINTRODUCTORY PERIOD\n8\n9\n10\n11\n14\n15\n16\n16\n17\n17\nCHAPTER 3-STAYING CURRENT\nA. MAINTAINING REQUIRED CURRENCY\nMAINTAINING CURRENT CERTIFICATES\nCARRYING A VALID PASSPORT\nB. INTERNATIONAL REQUIREMENTS\nINTERNATIONAL ENTRY/EXIT REQUIREMENTS\nCRIMINAL RECORD\n20\n20\n20\n22\n22\n22\nil",
      "Virgin America\nINFLIGHT WORK RULES\nOct. 1, 2013\nRev. 5\nCHAPTER 4-BASES/ SATELLITE BASES AND GETTING TO WORK\nA.\nITM BASES\nGENERAL\nINITIAL BASE ASSIGNMENTS\nBASE BIDS\nPICKING UP OTHER FLYING\nB.\nSATELLITE BASES\nGENERAL\nC. NO DISPLACEMENT RULE\nD. VOLUNTARY TRANSFERS\nE COMMUTING BENEFITS AND RULES\nCOMMUTING RULES\nCREW PARKING BENEFITS\nTRANSIT BENEFITS\nTEAM TRAVEL PRIVILEGES\nINFLIGHT JUMPSEAT RULES\n24\n24\n24\n25\n25\n26\n26\n27\n27\n27\n27\n28\n29\n30\n30\nCHAPTER 5-OUR RESERVE SYSTEM\nA. GENERAL\nB. RESERVE BIDDING\nC. VIRGIN DAYS OFF (VDOs)\nD. RESERVE SCHEDULE AND MONTHLY GUARANTEE\nE. CONSTRUCTING RESERVE LINES\nF.\nSHORT CALL RESERVE (SCR) RULES\nG. AIRPORT RESERVE (RRR) RULES\nH. LONG CALL RESERVE (LCR) RULES\nI. LCR NON-CONTACTABLE/SICK NOT ENOUGH NOTICE\nJ.\nTRANSITION-LCR-SCR\nK. ASSIGNMENT OF OPENTIME\nL. RESERVE SCHEDULE ADJUSTMENTS\nM. OUT-OF-BASE RESERVE ASSIGNMENTS\nN. SATELLITE BASE RESERVE\nCHAPTER 6-LINEHOLDER BIDDING\nA. THE MONTHLY BID PROCESS\nGENERAL\nELIGIBILITY FOR BIDDING\nBIDDING FOR A SCHEDULE\nB. BID AWARD\nGENERAL\n31\n32\n33\n33\n34\n35\n36\n37\n38\n39\n39\n43\n45\n46\n47\n47\n47\n48\n49\n49\niii"
